EXPLAIN FORMAT=TREE SELECT 1 FROM (SELECT t1.a FROM t1 LEFT JOIN t2 ON (EXISTS (
SELECT /*+NO_BNL()*/ t3.b FROM t3 LEFT JOIN (SELECT b FROM t2 WHERE false
GROUP BY b) AS tt ON t3.a = t2.a and t3.b = t1.b))) AS aaa;
EXPLAIN
-> Remove duplicate (t1, t2) rows using temporary table (weedout)
    -> Nested loop left join
        -> Invalidate materialized tables (row from t1)
            -> Index scan on t1 using a
        -> Result cache : cache keys(t1.b)
            -> Nested loop left join
                -> Nested loop inner join
                    -> Table scan on t3
                    -> Result cache : cache keys(t1.b, t3.a, t3.b)
                        -> Index scan on t2 using a
                -> Result cache : cache keys(t1.b, t2.a, t3.a, t3.b)
                    -> Filter: ((t3.a = t2.a) and (t3.b = t1.b))
                        -> Table scan on tt
                            -> Materialize (invalidate on row from t1)
                                -> Zero rows (Impossible WHERE)

